  'COM_CONVERTFORMS_BROWSER_AUTOCOMPLETE' => 'Browser Autocomplete',
  'COM_CONVERTFORMS_BROWSER_AUTOCOMPLETE_DESC' => 'Controls whether the browser may suggest previously entered values for this field.<br><br>Default: lets the browser decide (no autocomplete attribute is set). <br><br>Off: explicitly disables autocomplete (autocomplete=off). <br><br>Custom: set a specific autocomplete token such as email, given-name, or tel.',
